.TH ACTION_BIND_PAD 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
action_bind_pad \- Bind action a to a gamepad button, replacing any previous button for that action
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqactions.h\(dq
.BI "void action_bind_pad(ActionMap *m, int a, PadButton b);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Bind action a to a gamepad button, replacing any previous button for that action. Use positional names (PAD_SOUTH for confirm/jump) so the binding is right on every controller.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH MODULE
input (src/engine/input/actions.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR action_bind_key (3),
.BR action_bind_axis (3),
.BR PadButton (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
